[00:49.090]I wish that we were on TV
[00:49.090]我希望我们在电视里
[00:51.820]Just like in Pokemon
[00:51.820]就像口袋妖怪
[00:54.270]You'd be a Pika-girl, In the Poke world
[00:54.270]你会成为皮卡女孩，在神奇宝贝世界
[00:57.310]Yes, life would be so fun
[00:57.310]是的，生活会变得十分有趣
[00:59.710]I'd be a trainer boy, and I would make the choice
[00:59.710]我会变成训练师，我会做出一个选择
[01:02.800]To go and search for you
[01:02.800]去寻找你
[01:05.200]I'd throw my pokeball, and I would catch them all
